# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# commit -- signing (Phase 17f, item F8).
#
# A cell whose invocation needs the tool's ed25519 engine cites `evidence:`.
# The engine is a build option the reference tool may omit, and such a build
# answers every ed25519 invocation with `Requested signature type is not
# implemented`, which describes the build and states nothing about the port
# (harness.md, "Verdicts"). The cited tests gate on that feature and on
# `OSTRYA_REQUIRE_OSTREE_ED25519`, so the claim holds exactly where the engine
# is present. The `--sign-type` name-resolution cells below need no engine, so
# they stand as `run:` cells on every build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

