spec: format-reference.md#object-store-layout
note: the match set holds commit objects alone, so a prefix carried by a dirtree,
 a dirmeta, or a file object and by no commit resolves to nothing in both, at one,
 four, and eight characters. The cited test reads the object it names out of
 `objects/` and holds the two stores to the same object names first, the corpus
 and the timestamp being fixed.

