# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `export`, Phase 17f (`F17`).
#
# The tar stream is a transport interface. The two implementations write
# different tar dialects, so the claim over a stream is the member list, the
# member metadata, and the tree the stream extracts to, and never the bytes
# (`../format-reference.md`, "tar"). No text oracle reads standard output for
# a cell whose invocation writes a stream there: such a cell states a member
# name the stream holds and cites the test that compares the two streams
# member by member.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

