expect-stdout: contains "dir/nested.txt"
expect-stderr: empty
ref-expect-exit: 0
ref-expect-stdout: contains "dir/nested.txt"
ref-expect-stderr: empty
oracle: exit-status
outcome: full
severity: interop
evidence: ostrya_cli::cli::export_options_match_the_tool,
 ostrya_cli::cli::export_no_xattrs_imports_to_one_commit
spec: format-reference.md#tar
note: item `F17`. The option drops every `SCHILY.xattr.*` record the port
 emits, and the tool emits none in any case, so this is the form whose stream
 the two write in agreement over every fact an ostree tree carries. The second
 cited test writes each side's archive to a file, imports it with each
 implementation, and states one commit checksum for all four imports, which is
 the checksum oracle for the option.

