outcome: full
severity: interop
spec: format-reference.md#diff
note: a repeated value option is accepted and takes the last occurrence, which
 is the convention `cli-surface.md`, "P2", states for a repeated `--depth` and
 a repeated `--keep-younger-than`. Two commit sides ignore the value, so the
 cell holds the acceptance and
 `diff/owner-override-reaches-the-second-side` cites the test that holds the
 last occurrence over a directory side.

