spec: format-reference.md#diff
note: such a name is listed, descended into, and carried to the end of the run
 in both, and both exit 0. The cited test holds the exit status, the count of
 paths named, the valid name that changes alongside them, and the added entry
 below a directory whose name is not valid UTF-8.

