setup: repo-with-commit
outcome: lossy
severity: interop
loss: a repeated switch, the class `export/no-xattrs-given-twice` and
 `prune/commit-only-repeated` already record. The tool takes a second `-v`,
 `--view`, `--raw`, or `--list-metadata-keys` and runs the command, and takes
 the last occurrence of a repeated `--print-metadata-key`; the port refuses
 each at exit 1 (`cli-surface.md`, "summary").
evidence: ostrya_cli::cli::summary_argument_handling_parts_from_the_tool
